  "notes": [
    "Immutable BPool, bound and finalized in its creation tx, so deployment sets the age. Pre-anchor repeated single joins (2022, Apr 2026) hit the STA pool whose reserve was left at dust by the 2020 deflationary-token drain, or were one-off joins into dormant pools: not this rounding defect.",
    "Copycats (83 senders) used both join selectors on 186 BFactory BPools; all are in the bundle. BPool forks with other runtimes (factory 0x58bab52a… and others on Ethereum, pools on BSC and Gnosis) are other codebases and excluded. Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base and Avalanche show no such calls.",
    "Loss is each tx's net token outflow from BFactory BPools, priced on DefiLlama 4h series at tx time; loss.mjs on the attacker's own 27 txs agrees within 0.1%. UNI-V2 LP tokens count at their WETH share of pair reserves; 49 dead or unlisted tokens have no market price and carry zero."
